# Optional. The live AI checks (npm run gen:check, npm run diag:check) read
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment, or VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from this file.
# Setting the environment variable in your shell is safer than a file.
#
# The deployed site never calls the model: it only displays results that were
# recorded with `--save`. It does not need a key.
#
# WARNING: Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the bundle as a
# plain string. Anything built with this set has the key embedded in its
# JavaScript. Never run a build you intend to publish while it is set.

VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
